    <sys:String x:Key="FirstRun_Title">👋 What this tool will (and won't) do</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="FirstRun_Body">Observes only by default and does not touch any process. Auto-cleanup, commit relief and the lease API are all off until you enable them in Settings. System-level cache clearing needs admin rights; without them it is honestly logged as "skipped" instead of pretending to succeed. All data stays on this machine under %APPDATA%\MemPilot.</sys:String>
