    <sys:String x:Key="MakeRoom_Step0Body">Clearing cache / trimming working sets brings the "available physical memory" number back, but does not reduce commit — and commit is what makes AI jobs fail. To reduce commit, use the plan below to close idle processes.</sys:String>
